#: ../../../library-easy.rst:62
msgid ""
"``deque.appendleft`` adds an item at the front in O(1), giving ``deque([0, "
"1, 2, 3])``. The ``repr`` of a deque includes the ``deque(...)`` wrapper."
msgstr ""
"``deque.appendleft`` añade un elemento al principio en O(1), dando "
"``deque([0, 1, 2, 3])``. El ``repr`` de un deque incluye el envoltorio "
"``deque(...)``."

