#: ../../../library-easy.rst:89
msgid ""
"``json.dumps`` always uses double quotes (valid JSON) and, by default, a "
"space after each ``:`` and ``,``. Python's single-quoted ``repr`` is not "
"JSON."
msgstr ""
"``json.dumps`` siempre usa comillas dobles (JSON válido) y, por defecto, un "
"espacio tras cada ``:`` y ``,``. El ``repr`` de Python con comillas simples "
"no es JSON."

