#: ../../../library-easy.rst:433
msgid ""
"``Decimal`` built from strings avoids binary floating-point error, so "
"``Decimal(\"0.1\") + Decimal(\"0.2\")`` is exactly ``0.3`` (unlike ``0.1 + "
"0.2`` with floats)."
msgstr ""
"``Decimal`` construido a partir de cadenas evita el error del punto flotante"
" binario, así que ``Decimal(\"0.1\") + Decimal(\"0.2\")`` es exactamente "
"``0.3`` (a diferencia de ``0.1 + 0.2`` con floats)."

